    // 「新增商机可跟进，立项通过后方可更新阶段、投标、赢丢单操作。」 Ruled (hotcrm-R74b
    // item 2, B): before 立项 is approved, Generate Quote REFUSES and creates
    // nothing. Steps 15 and 18 put quoting after the deal's approval too.
